      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The crab can breathe air and water.

      ## Actions

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+1,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 11) from one of two claws.

